00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:40.870
And one of the challenges we have with

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:43.150
an asynchronous input, that is something

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:45.070
that's not synchronized to a clock on

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:47.030
the on a digital circuit,

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:49.150
is if if the asynchronous input changes

00:11:49.160 --> 00:11:50.590
