00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:26.990
And typically three or four of those

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:28.830
make a synchronization circuit to the

00:12:28.840 --> 00:12:31.270
point where the metastability the

00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:33.070
chances of metastability getting through

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:35.470
to the main circuit is is basically

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:38.030
reduced to such a low probability it's

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:40.310
